    rdfs:label "Magic Card Collection Individuals"@en ;
    rdfs:comment """An aggregator ontology for the card individuals of a
personal Magic: The Gathering card collection. It contains no individuals of
its own; instead it imports one instance graph per set from the sets/
directory, each defining one Card individual per collected printing with its
characteristics, format legalities and official rulings. Card data was sourced
from Scryfall. This file also imports MagicCardsOntology to reuse all existing
class, property, set, keyword, subtype, format and legality definitions."""@en .
